{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-05_beg","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-05","title":"演繹文明","storyCode":"11-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b0a2afaf41d3d7fd204c65c702d3d3262402d68702bb754ac210b3e3616a0b08","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"萊托試圖說服掌握著自救軍情報的戈爾丁投向城防軍。變形者接近戈爾丁，Logos追著變形者而來，與變形者借戲對談。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來這裡做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我說的那樣，只是來看一場演出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......孩子們，都到我身後來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊托中校，無意冒犯，但這裡不歡迎你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不用這麼生分吧，戈爾丁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一向認同你的努力，越是艱難的時代，教育的重要性就越應該被凸顯出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中校先生，您這麼說，好像自己和這個“艱難的時代”沒什麼關係似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管什麼時代，您穿得可總是十足體面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您胸前的勳章也越來越多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"協助軍事委員會管理倫蒂尼姆不是一件輕鬆的事情，我也遇到了很多......困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我對這座城市的熱愛始終未曾改變，就這點而言，我和你們一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鞋匠湯姆肯定很贊同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"湯姆也是我的朋友，發生那樣的事我並不樂意見到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是喝醉了酒，嘟囔“陛下”和“蒸汽騎士”什麼的，他甚至不怎麼會拼“薩卡茲”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們存在的意義不只是活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想指控我為維多利亞的叛徒嗎，戈爾丁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士們，我敬佩你們的勇氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你們誤會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天來這裡，只是想再看一看這所學校罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茉莉小姐，很遺憾，看來你已經忘記我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......忘記？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在這裡度過的時間不比你少，茉莉小姐。我甚至還記得你和同你一起來的那批孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，軍校畢業後，我的閒置時間就沒有那麼多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可戈爾丁，你曾是信任我的。我們時常一起談論高盧的歷史，聊起那些不朽的文學——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了，萊托中校。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我十分感謝你的父親，他多年來一直資助著這所學校，他試圖為孩子們點燃智慧的火炬，驅散蒙昧與混沌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾以為你是和他一樣的人......而你，卻親手熄滅了那點本就微弱的火光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？戈爾丁，那你覺得，這所學校為什麼能維持到今天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——你別想威脅我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並沒有威脅各位的理由和動機，孩子們還在呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈爾丁女士，我們都是高盧遺民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都知道，戰爭是最無情的毀滅者，除了帶走成千上萬的生命，還會摧毀人類為通向智識做出的一切努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想看見倫蒂尼姆變成下一個林貢斯，也不想讓剛才看到的如此美好的戲劇演出就此絕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我為我自己選擇的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我無法贊同你的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林貢斯的皇家歌劇院已經化作灰燼，而《凱旋頌》仍在各時各地被反復演繹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"建築會倒塌，巨構會瓦解，但我們曾凝集其中的結晶卻永不會消亡。那是我們的教育、我們的文化、我們的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭的陰雲越是濃烈，我們就越是需要堅持信念，需要相信美的東西，來提醒自己身為人類與野獸的差別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你相信這種對抗能贏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們所代表的那些東西，恐懼、權力、殺戮......永遠無法馴化每一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只能相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要有光，我們就會向光而行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我羡慕你，戈爾丁女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看頭頂的陰雲吧，暴風雨就快來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在落雷之前，我們都還有時間，我們都還有選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望有一天......我能看到這齣戲的結尾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"narration","text":"離開學校之後，城防軍指揮官並未在街上停留。\n他的確是一個人來的，並沒有更多城防軍官兵來到附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"她必須找到亞當斯，將消息傳出去。\n不管那位指揮官表現得多麼沒有敵意，他都不會無緣無故地找上他們學校。\n茉莉不知道，孩子們不知道，可是戈爾丁知道他為什麼會來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼突然這麼多薩卡茲？"},{"type":"narration","text":"通往書店的路很熟悉，她在過去兩年多的時間裡走了無數回。\n可今天這條路突然變得很長，長到一眼望不到頭，她又想到了薩卡茲進城的那一天。\n她真的能夠改變嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須相信，我必須......"},{"type":"narration","text":"戈爾丁突然感覺到自己被一種恐懼扼住了咽喉。\n她簡直要吐出來了，她轉身逃離。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘭西，帕蒂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些孩子......！蘭——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或許這樣簡單的任務並不值得勞您大駕，閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的話，你應該選擇把戈爾丁女士抓起來，萊托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德就會這麼做。換作老紅眼病的話，整座學校都不會剩下一個活口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，我們知道你不是薩卡茲。你還想著給自己，給城防軍，給這座城市裡的居民留一點最後的體面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們相信這樣會更保險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘭西，帕蒂......不知道孩子們有沒有危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中校先生，我很害怕。我既害怕像您這樣的人和薩卡茲傷害孩子們，也害怕......孩子們變成像您一樣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您的語氣和這位昏迷的女士一模一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我們在感受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她關心那些年幼的維多利亞人，勝過關心自己。我們能感受到，卻很難理解。尤其這種關心還不是基於血緣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......閣下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們對你們很感興趣。透過你們，我們能更好地理解自己......理解薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想從我們身上找尋一些答案？關於......什麼的答案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊托，你並不像那種對薩卡茲感到好奇的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任務是第一優先的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把這位茉莉小姐帶回去吧，中校先生。看好她。我們會留在戈爾丁女士身邊，為接下來的戰爭取得更多情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，閣下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人發現我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是否需要我讓更多士兵過來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，士兵們攔不住他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他從特蕾西婭那裡學到了不少。我們也許很快就能......輕鬆地聊聊天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......茉莉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我出去的這段時間，沒出什麼事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，蘭西和帕蒂嚇壞了，拉爾夫那幾個大孩子帶著小傢伙們休息去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。我在想......孩子們會喜歡這些戲的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的努力是有意義的，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不用在意那個城防軍指揮官的話，戈爾丁女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我不是很舒服，我想休息一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，茉莉，這裡就麻煩你收拾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這齣戲該有一個結尾的，蒸汽騎士已經走到王宮門前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過幾天，孩子們會把最後一幕演完的，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個故事的結尾只要沒被演繹，就總是有很多種可能性的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，已經上演的戲，也未必無法改變，人們總是想看到更新鮮的版本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在一旁看了很久了，是吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然舞台還在，我們能不能重新演一遍呢？從第一幕開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都總是在幻想，如果一切沒有發生會怎樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推演沒有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果只是些渺茫的可能性......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好先生，若您正好閒來無事，不如加入這場演出吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"早安，閣下！您的臉上佈滿愁容，請問是什麼讓您如此心焦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“神秘觀眾”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"勝利的號角聲已在城牆上盤旋了三天三夜，可我的心為何還是如此焦灼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們偉大的將軍不是早已凱旋了嗎？讚美他的英勇與無畏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“神秘觀眾”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"英勇？無畏？也許是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“神秘觀眾”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一次激進的號召，將我們的信念凝成一團。代價，卻是近在眼前的毀滅和仇恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你本該侍奉一位君主，卻將你的忠誠獻給了一位賊人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i02"},{"type":"narration","text":"舞台上，神秘的觀眾向前一步，視線從眼前人的身上移向了遠方。\n他並非在醞釀情緒，相反，他在整理那些早已塵封的關於另一處戰場的往事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“神秘觀眾”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我追隨的並非君主，而是一種正直，一股勇氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再往前走的話，迎接你的只有毀滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“神秘觀眾”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"活著看到這個國家被暴君帶著走向毀滅，遠比個體毀滅更可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎知她的結局，閣下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“神秘觀眾”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我能預見她的結局，正如我知曉她的來路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"胡說！你尚年幼，怎敢張口懷念往昔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“神秘觀眾”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰能令太陽永不下落？生出這種欲望本就是最大的貪婪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“神秘觀眾”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為了維繫這盛大的光輝，我見過無數瘋狂之舉。他們或是化身強盜，或是相互爭鬥，最終只會加速這個國家的腐朽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i02"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“茉莉”在舞台上轉了個身，輕踱幾步，再回過身，將面目隱藏在燈光下的陰影裡。\n但另一位演員先開口了，他神色沉靜如水，微微側手，又將雙手交叉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“神秘觀眾”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們不願承認，下墜之人想要攀住日光，握在手中的卻只可能是閃電。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"難道人們就只能甘願墜落？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“神秘觀眾”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人們也可以選擇不再回望山巔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“神秘觀眾”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"假使他們掉轉自己的視線，他們會發現面前的深淵不是深淵，而是包含無窮可能性的沃土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"深淵可被戰勝？你並不清楚深淵的真相，也未必知曉，時間緊迫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“神秘觀眾”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"深淵就在身前，我等可用肉身填於深淵，用鮮血燒盡殘垣，給後人留下一片廣闊原野。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只有等到舊日的灰燼全部被吹散，原野上才能長出新的糧食，來餵飽我們的下一代。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
